WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.511
took her apron out of her backpack.

2
00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:22.495
Miss Shelly had asked all the Kids Central kids to bring aprons today.

3
00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:24.977
Nina's apron was purple.

4
00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.020
It was a present from Aunt Sujong in Korea.

5
00:00:30.244 --> 00:00:33.307
Aunt Sujong visited the United States once a year.

6
00:00:33.327 --> 00:00:35.669
"Hey, Bobby.

7
00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.351
Nice apron," Jason teased.

8
00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:42.174
Bobby was wearing a pink apron with ruffles.

9
00:00:42.194 --> 00:00:45.997
"It's my sister's," Bobby grumbled.

10
00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:48.399
"What are you wearing?"

11
00:00:48.419 --> 00:00:52.142
"My old pajamas," Jason said.

12
00:00:52.162 --> 00:00:55.464
"It's also my smock for art class."

13
00:01:00.108 --> 00:01:00.408
"Buon giorno!"

14
00:01:00.448 --> 00:01:01.329
Miss Shelly called.

15
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.051
She was wearing a chef's hat.

16
00:01:04.071 --> 00:01:07.434
"That's Italian for 'hello.'

17
00:01:08.595 --> 00:01:12.618
Today we're going to make my favorite Italian food—pizza!

18
00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:17.923
But we're going to make small snack pizzas called pizza bagels!"

19
00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:20.985
"I've eaten bagels.

20
00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:23.347
And I've eaten pizza.

21
00:01:24.248 --> 00:01:27.311
But I've never eaten pizza bagels before!"

22
00:01:27.891 --> 00:01:28.592
Nina said.

23
00:01:29.844 --> 00:01:34.989
"First you can each take six bagel halves from the basket," Miss Shelly told them.

24
00:01:40.053 --> 00:01:41.534
We each get six?"

25
00:01:42.055 --> 00:01:42.895
Bobby cried.

26
00:01:42.915 --> 00:01:46.158
"Yep. What's next, Bobby?"

27
00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.539
Miss Shelly asked.

28
00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:53.124
"Spread pizza sauce on the bagels," Bobby read.

29
00:01:54.365 --> 00:01:57.208
Nina spread the sauce in a circle on her bagels.

30
00:02:00.576 --> 00:02:02.357
"Wait, I need more."

31
00:02:03.378 --> 00:02:06.379
Jason leaned over the table to take the jar from Nina.

32
00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:09.161
His bagels slipped off his dish.

33
00:02:09.181 --> 00:02:14.103
"Ah!" Nina jumped out of the way of the sliding bagels.

34
00:02:15.584 --> 00:02:20.086
Splat. Jason's bagels landed sauce-side down on the gym floor.

35
00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:23.748
"Oh!" Jason moaned.

36
00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:26.210
"Now what, Miss Shelly?"

37
00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:30.312
"Sorry. We only had enough for six each.

38
00:02:31.404 --> 00:02:34.605
Someone will have to share with you," Miss Shelly answered.

39
00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:37.946
"I'll share mine," Bobby said.

40
00:02:37.966 --> 00:02:42.027
"Thank you, Bobby," said Miss Shelly.

41
00:02:42.047 --> 00:02:44.407
"That's very kind."

42
00:02:44.428 --> 00:02:49.169
"Now sprinkle shredded cheese on the bagels.

43
00:02:50.409 --> 00:02:52.970
Not too much," Nina read out loud.

44
00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:00.932
I love cheese!"

45
00:03:01.564 --> 00:03:02.345
Izzie cried.

46
00:03:02.365 --> 00:03:05.006
"Then choose a topping.

47
00:03:06.227 --> 00:03:08.648
Sprinkle it over the cheese," Izzie read.

48
00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.351
pick bacon."

49
00:03:13.371 --> 00:03:16.893
"I pick olives," Nina said.

50
00:03:16.913 --> 00:03:20.555
"Look! I'm making a pizza pie!"

51
00:03:21.535 --> 00:03:22.756
The girls turned around.

52
00:03:23.917 --> 00:03:26.118
Bobby was tossing two bagels in the air.

53
00:03:27.399 --> 00:03:29.240
He was pretending to make pizza dough.

54
00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.516
Jason was laughing.

55
00:03:31.917 --> 00:03:37.198
"Boys, do not play with food," Miss Shelly warned.

56
00:03:37.218 --> 00:03:42.740
"Whoa!" Bobby tripped and bumped into Jason.

57
00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.540
Their plate went flying into the air.

58
00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:48.161
Jason leaped to catch it.

59
00:03:49.241 --> 00:03:50.202
But it was too late.

60
00:03:51.702 --> 00:03:55.003
"Six more pizza bagels gone."

61
00:03:55.403 --> 00:03:56.503
Miss Shelly sighed.

62
00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.561
"Well, let's put yours in the toaster oven, girls."

63
00:04:06.204 --> 00:04:07.785
"Something is burning!"

64
00:04:08.325 --> 00:04:10.166
Miss Shelly ran to the toaster oven.

65
00:04:15.009 --> 00:04:16.170
pizza bagels!"

66
00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.490
Izzie cried.

67
00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:21.412
"Too much cheese," Jason said.

68
00:04:22.593 --> 00:04:24.394
The cheese had dripped off the bagels.

69
00:04:25.695 --> 00:04:27.716
It was burned onto the bottom of the oven.

70
00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.322
"But there are still six good pizza bagels here."

71
00:04:33.623 --> 00:04:36.164
Miss Shelly pulled Nina's bagels out of the oven.

72
00:04:36.184 --> 00:04:38.986
"Enough for all of us."

73
00:04:39.586 --> 00:04:40.487
Nina smiled.

74
00:04:40.507 --> 00:04:42.528
"Dig in, everyone."

75
00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:47.471
"Thanks. Hooray for Nina!"

76
00:04:47.891 --> 00:04:48.852
everyone cheered.

77
00:04:50.112 --> 00:04:53.254
Miss Shelly took off her chef's hat and put it on Nina's head.

78
00:04:54.955 --> 00:04:55.756
Nina beamed.

79
00:04:56.916 --> 00:04:59.081
She couldn't wait to make pizza bagels for Aunt
